02:14:41,400 --> 02:14:43,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 20, merong 30. So mukhang hindi

2914
02:14:43,720 --> 02:14:44,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: consistent.

2915
02:14:44,200 --> 02:14:45,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po, ah,

2916
02:14:45,180 --> 02:14:48,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pinag-iwanag po sa akin ngayon, ang naging practice po

2917
02:14:48,060 --> 02:14:49,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil nakita ko po yung mga

2918
02:14:49,640 --> 02:14:51,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: projects po na napakita ay

2919
02:14:51,560 --> 02:14:52,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maharlika Highway nga.

2920
02:14:52,780 --> 02:14:59,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang Maharlika Highway po talaga is centrally managed pero ang regions po ang nag-implement.

2921
02:14:59,080 --> 02:15:13,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So ganun din po yun. Papadala po ang pondo para sa pagsasayos ng Maharlika Highway sa central office kahit na mabababa kahit na below 50 million pero ito po ay binababa din agad sa regional office.

2922
02:15:14,080 --> 02:15:27,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi nyo Maharlika Highway pero merong flood control, ito merong construction of road, merong construction of bridges, below 50 million, ayun nga po 5 million, 7.1, etc.

2923
02:15:29,520 --> 02:15:40,440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang flood control din po yung 002 projects in the mass. Centrally managed din po pag-ayan. Yun ang sinabi sa akin ng mga matatagal mo sa DPWH.

2924
02:15:40,440 --> 02:15:43,340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So kahit na po yan ay mabababa sa 50 million.

2925
02:15:43,340 --> 02:15:43,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Flood control po, flood control.

2926
02:15:44,902 --> 02:15:50,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero meron din district allocation sa flood control. Meron DEO na flood control projects.

2927
02:15:51,240 --> 02:15:58,600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Ang desisyon naman po kasi kung sino ang eventually mag-i-implement, e depende po dun sa mga thresholds na sineset ng department.

2928
02:15:59,240 --> 02:16:05,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Iba po yung pag-atanggap ng pondo, iba po yung pag-implement ng proyekto.

2929
02:16:05,460 --> 02:16:12,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So yun po ang ano, mukhang ito na po ang kinagawian, ika nga. Like I said.

2930
02:16:13,520 --> 02:16:25,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nag-uumpisa pa rin po tayo sa mga reforma. And we will be very, very open and willing po na kung meron po mga dagdag na reformang, pwede tayong ma-i-implement na galing sa committee natin.

2931
02:16:25,740 --> 02:16:28,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will be more than willing and open to implement.

2932
02:16:28,120 --> 02:16:31,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair, alam ko, tapos na yung oras. Kaya nga, thank you for indulging.

2933
02:16:31,800 --> 02:16:35,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Just to conclude, meron marami pa po ito. Kaya lang, round 2 na lang.

2934
02:16:35,940 --> 02:16:42,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But just sabi, merong rule, 50 million and up, central office, lower.

2935
02:16:42,340 --> 02:16:46,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Regions. Pero may mga iba-ibang exceptions. Kasi yan na raw ang kinagawian.

2936
02:16:48,080 --> 02:16:52,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Ang ipinopose natin dito, ano yung kinagawian na yun?

2937
02:16:52,260 --> 02:17:06,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, among others, nakita natin sa flood control, yung nasa central, nasa region, sabi niyan, indication, ang isang issue dyan, sino ang may-ari ng proyekto o kontrata?

2938
02:17:06,140 --> 02:17:12,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sino yung magtatakda ng contractor? Hindi po ba ganun ang realidad nun?

2939
02:17:13,660 --> 02:17:21,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O, yung nasa central, may may-ari niyan. Yung sa district, DEO, iba rin yung may-ari niyan. Hindi po ba ganun?

2940
02:17:22,120 --> 02:17:25,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi ko masasagot yung dati. Pero ngayon, no?

2941
02:17:26,060 --> 02:17:26,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah ngayon, hindi.

2942
02:17:27,060 --> 02:17:31,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Pero nandyan pa rin yung kalakaran. Okay, thank you. Next round na lang po tayo.

2943
02:17:31,720 --> 02:17:40,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Well, thank you. Thank you, thank you, Honorable Antonio Tino. Salamat sa maiksimong interpelasyon.

2944
02:17:41,980 --> 02:17:42,500
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next.

2945
02:17:42,500 --> 02:17:57,060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: turn to interpelate is from the majority, Congressman Milagros Aquino. Congressman Mark Cojuangco.

2946
02:17:59,740 --> 02:18:02,020
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Thank you. Thank you, Chairman.

2947
02:18:05,080 --> 02:18:24,240
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Firstly, I'd like to say na masaya po ako sa patakbo ni Secretary Vince Dizon sa DPWH.

2948
02:18:25,240 --> 02:18:33,940
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Parang breath of fresh air ang transparency ng DPWH ngayon.

2949
02:18:34,920 --> 02:18:50,060
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Gusto ko pong i-manifest na todo po ang suporta nitong representation na ito sa buong budget ng DPWH nationwide.

2950
02:18:50,060 --> 02:18:57,420
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Most specially, the budget of Region 1 sa DPWH.

2951
02:18:59,700 --> 02:19:13,900
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: We would like to manifest a thought na dapat sanang pag-isipan po nating lahat, lalong-lalo na ang DPWH and maybe some other agencies.

2952
02:19:15,620 --> 02:19:23,240
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Gusto po nitong representation na ma-prioritize ang right-of-way acquisition.

2953
02:19:24,640 --> 02:19:33,120
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Kapag wala pong right-of-way acquisition, hindi po maaari ang mga proyekto.

2954
02:19:34,620 --> 02:19:38,980
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: In general, not just in our district but nationwide.

2955
02:19:42,200 --> 02:19:47,300
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Sayang po ang civil works budget kung walang right of way budget.

2956
02:19:47,300 --> 02:19:51,620
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Sa public perception, pwede pong

2957
02:19:51,620 --> 02:19:53,680
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ang right-of-way purchase

2958
02:19:53,680 --> 02:19:55,900
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ay lumabas na cleanest form

2959
02:19:55,900 --> 02:19:58,780
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: or purest form

2960
02:19:58,780 --> 02:19:59,940
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: of public spending.

2961
02:19:59,940 --> 02:20:02,920
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: kasi wala pong hao-siao

2962
02:20:02,920 --> 02:20:05,500
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: sa pagbili ng right of way.

2963
02:20:07,640 --> 02:20:17,260
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Pansinin po natin na ang ating mga kalsada, marami pong walang sapat na sidewalk.

2964
02:20:17,680 --> 02:20:26,100
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Napapansin ko po yan lalong-lalo na pag ako po ay bumibiyahe sa ibang bansa.

2965
02:20:27,320 --> 02:20:35,200
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Nakakainggit po na malalapad ang mga sidewalk ng iba-ibang bansa ng Pilipinas.

2966
02:20:35,600 --> 02:20:43,360
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Sana po dumating ang panahon na ganun din po dito, lalong-lalo na sa Metro Manila.

2967
02:20:43,460 --> 02:20:46,320
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Ewan ko po kung paano pa gagawin yan.

2968
02:20:47,260 --> 02:21:00,900
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Sa palagay ko po, dapat ang isang kongresista ay may karapatan magmungkahi na kung gusto niyang mabigyan

2969
02:21:00,900 --> 02:21:12,460
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ang barangay sa distrito niya ng pondo para sa pagbili ng open space, maaari pong mangyari yun.

2970
02:21:12,460 --> 02:21:16,440
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Sana po i-consider ng ating mga mambabatas dito

2971
02:21:16,440 --> 02:21:31,080
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ng Committee on Appropriations na payagan po yan hanggang sa kagustuhan ng isang kongresista na mangyari po yan.

2972
02:21:31,080 --> 02:21:36,460
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Yun lang po ang aking pahayag ngayong hapon.

2973
02:21:36,460 --> 02:21:45,240
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Muli, congratulations po sa magandang trabaho ng ating butihing sekretaring, Vince Dizon.

2974
02:21:47,000 --> 02:21:49,620
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Maraming salamat po sa inyong lahat.

2975
02:21:49,620 --> 02:21:50,800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Kong Mark.

2976
02:21:50,900 --> 02:21:51,740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you, Kong Mark.

2977
02:21:51,920 --> 02:21:52,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you very much po.

2978
02:21:53,000 --> 02:21:53,440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yes.

2979
02:21:55,000 --> 02:22:00,440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sisigundahan ko lang po talagang kailangan po ng supporta po ng DPWH sa right-of-way acquisition.

2980
02:22:00,740 --> 02:22:06,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi ito po talagang perennial na problema po kung bakit po natitinga ang mga proyekto.

2981
02:22:06,320 --> 02:22:06,740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you.

2982
02:22:06,780 --> 02:22:07,320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraming salamat po.

2983
02:22:07,800 --> 02:22:10,220
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next to interpellate is from the minority.

2984
02:22:13,560 --> 02:22:23,580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung Presley de Jesus, if not around, we'll proceed to the next from the minority.

2985
02:22:23,940 --> 02:22:25,800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Congressman Bong Suntay.

2986
02:22:26,300 --> 02:22:28,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

2987
02:22:29,040 --> 02:22:32,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hi, Secretary Vince. Magandang hapon po sa inyo.

2988
02:22:33,180 --> 02:22:52,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, I think it will be no argument pag sinabi natin that the 2027 budget is being proposed against an institutional background of large audit deficiencies, weak project preparation, extreme flood control controversy, ghost projects,

2989
02:22:52,140 --> 02:22:53,360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: questionable budget issues.

2990
02:22:54,020 --> 02:22:58,660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, you've been around the TV and the social media talking about these things.

2991
02:22:58,920 --> 02:23:02,020
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And hindi nyo namang kasalanan dahil ito'y inabutan nyo na.

2992
02:23:02,020 --> 02:23:09,420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ngunit, ano ho ba yung nagawa natin preparation para hindi na maulit yung mga ganitong bagay?

2993
02:23:11,020 --> 02:23:13,100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Salamat po, Congressman Suntay.

2994
02:23:13,780 --> 02:23:16,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kagaya po nung na-present natin kanina,

2995
02:23:17,280 --> 02:23:20,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pinigit po natin talaga na maging napaka-stricto.

2996
02:23:22,460 --> 02:23:29,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa pagsumiti pa lang ng mga proyekto sa budget ngayong 2027,

2997
02:23:32,180 --> 02:23:38,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dati-dati po, alam naman po ng lahat ito na madalas kapag po nagsusumiti ng proyekto sa DPWH,

2998
02:23:40,100 --> 02:23:42,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: madalas po yan, project title at cost ka.

2999
02:23:42,480 --> 02:23:45,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala pong mga supporting documents yan.

3000
02:23:45,060 --> 02:23:53,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Madalas, hindi po yan yung mga priorities ng mga regions, mga probinsya, mga local governments.

3001
02:23:54,260 --> 02:24:00,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikagawa po yan ay madalas hindi kino-coordinate sa mga local governments.

3002
02:24:00,120 --> 02:24:07,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At madalas din po, wala pa po yung mga program of work.

3003
02:24:07,020 --> 02:24:19,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, yan po, minarapat natin na i-require yan bago pa isumite ang mga proyekto for consideration sa budget.

3004
02:24:19,140 --> 02:24:23,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po ngayon, ito pong mga proyektong isinumite.

3005
02:24:23,160 --> 02:24:30,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At kung meron pong mga idadagdag o babaguyin o papalitan,

3006
02:24:30,860 --> 02:24:38,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kailangan po maging subject din yan sa same requirements na initially na in-impose po natin.

3007
02:24:38,580 --> 02:24:43,320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yan po tingin ko ang isa sa mga pinaka-importanting reforma.

3008
02:24:44,060 --> 02:24:48,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And I cannot overemphasize po, Mr. Chairman, Congressman,

3009
02:24:49,020 --> 02:24:53,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung pong accountability ng mga implementing offices.

3010
02:24:54,040 --> 02:24:58,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung pong certificate of implementability.

3011
02:24:58,140 --> 02:25:07,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: First time po itong ginawa na ang isang regional director o district engineer ay pipirma mismo.

3012
02:25:08,700 --> 02:25:17,800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nasasabihin na ang project ay merong coordination either sa local, sa regional, o sa probinsyal.

3013
02:25:17,800 --> 02:25:20,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Walang right-of-way issue.

3014
02:25:21,820 --> 02:25:23,300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Walang duplication.

3015
02:25:23,300 --> 02:25:33,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa mga nakaraang proyekto, walang duplicate funding source, at meron pong geotag physical photos.

3016
02:25:33,840 --> 02:25:38,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meaning, pupunta po siya doon, hindi lang mag-google map sa opisina,

3017
02:25:38,580 --> 02:25:45,820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pupunta po doon, kukuha yung picture yung project site, at i-upload sa sistema yung coordinates nun.

3018
02:25:47,600 --> 02:25:48,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo.

3019
02:25:48,040 --> 02:25:49,220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: First time po yan.

3020
02:25:50,140 --> 02:25:53,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po yan, kung tatanongin niyo po ako, ito po ay 100%.

3021
02:25:53,180 --> 02:25:54,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: foolproof?

3022
02:25:54,600 --> 02:25:55,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po.

3023
02:25:56,860 --> 02:26:00,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero ito po ang ginawa namin ngayon.

3024
02:26:00,680 --> 02:26:04,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tingin ko po, pwede pa po natin i-improve po sa mga susunod na taon.

3025
02:26:04,560 --> 02:26:12,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Gagawin na kung meron pong mga ideas ang honorable committee natin at mga members natin para gagawin pa pong paigtingin ito.

3026
02:26:13,040 --> 02:26:21,660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: O, kagaya ng sinabi nyo ngayon, yung mga projects being proposed, geotag, kung ano yung priority ng LGU, anong region,

3027
02:26:21,900 --> 02:26:23,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: identified yung mga...

3028
02:26:23,700 --> 02:26:29,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung mga coordinates nito, at ito yung ano na, yung may proper estimation na gawa.

3029
02:26:30,000 --> 02:26:30,460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tama mo ba?

3030
02:26:31,260 --> 02:26:31,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tama po.

3031
02:26:31,680 --> 02:26:49,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, when I went over the NEP for 2027, napansin ko lang that there were several clusters of appropriations that are materially less specific than the other entries na kasama.

3032
02:26:49,340 --> 02:26:53,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: For example, in page 675.

3033
02:26:53,580 --> 02:26:58,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Merong construction of evacuation centers, 180 million per region.

3034
02:26:58,460 --> 02:27:04,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sa 427, sa page 427, facilities for PWDs, 5 million per region.

3035
02:27:05,800 --> 02:27:12,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sa, in the same page, facilities for elderly senior citizens, 20 million per region.

3036
02:27:12,060 --> 02:27:18,740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, these are particularly unusual because of the identical allocation formula used.

3037
02:27:19,060 --> 02:27:23,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil, pag alam ko kasi, pag need-based infrastructure program,

3038
02:27:23,200 --> 02:27:27,840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: ang gagamitin natin, ordinarily, it will produce different amounts.

3039
02:27:27,840 --> 02:27:33,400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil sa population size, existing facility, hazard exposure, etc., etc.

3040
02:27:33,940 --> 02:27:39,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero, bakit ganon? Kung ang ginagamit natin ngayon ay...

3041
02:27:39,060 --> 02:27:40,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, ipapag-iwanag ko po yun.

3042
02:27:42,440 --> 02:27:45,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ipinag-iwanag po sa akin yan ng ating mga implementing offices.

3043
02:27:47,040 --> 02:27:52,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang evacuation centers po na nakapasok sa budget ng DPWH

3044
02:27:52,160 --> 02:27:53,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay base sa...

3045
02:27:54,020 --> 02:27:55,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ligtas Pinoy Centers Act.

3046
02:27:56,180 --> 02:28:03,420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At nakamandate po doon na ipapasok po sa DPWH ang budget ng mga evacuation centers.

3047
02:28:03,420 --> 02:28:10,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero, ang nagdi-determine po ng exact site at yung amounts.

3048
02:28:10,420 --> 02:28:14,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung amounts po, meron pong five-year plan po ito.

3049
02:28:14,660 --> 02:28:17,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At fixed po yung amounts niyan under the five-year plan.

3050
02:28:18,180 --> 02:28:23,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ang nagdi-determine po ng exact site ay ang NDRRMC.

3051
02:28:23,320 --> 02:28:24,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po ang DPWH.

3052
02:28:24,860 --> 02:28:28,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero, nakamandate po is two per region.

3053
02:28:29,100 --> 02:28:31,520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po, pati po yung amounts niyan, kaya pare-pareho,

3054
02:28:32,260 --> 02:28:39,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yan po ay base sa standards po na sinet din po ng NDRRMC and OCB.

3055
02:28:40,160 --> 02:28:42,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, yun po ang explanation sa atin.

3056
02:28:42,780 --> 02:28:47,900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yan po ay year in and year out.

3057
02:28:47,920 --> 02:28:49,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ganyan po, since napasa po ang badas.

3058
02:28:49,580 --> 02:28:50,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hindi naman ito...

3059
02:28:51,240 --> 02:28:52,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Concern ko lang yun dahil nga...

3060
02:28:52,940 --> 02:28:54,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There is no proper identification.

3061
02:28:55,040 --> 02:28:58,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Baka maging bangko lang ito na pagkukuna ng preferred...

3062
02:29:01,080 --> 02:29:03,900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact po, hindi kami po pwedeng mag-implement

3063
02:29:04,540 --> 02:29:07,960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: until magsabi po ang NDRRMC at ang OCD

3064
02:29:07,960 --> 02:29:12,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung saan namin ilagagay itong mga evacuation centers na ito.

3065
02:29:12,920 --> 02:29:17,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact, ang DPWH role lang po dito ay magpagawa.

3066
02:29:17,280 --> 02:29:21,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pagka po na-identify na ng NDRRMC

3067
02:29:21,120 --> 02:29:23,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: based on the IRR

3068
