DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: wala na pong tatapunan ng tubig ang buong Quezon City halos.

3445
02:42:18,720 --> 02:42:20,760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Gago na gago na po yung distrito ni Congbong.

3446
02:42:20,760 --> 02:42:23,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, ang challenge lang po talaga,

3447
02:42:23,400 --> 02:42:25,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na talaga po ito,

3448
02:42:25,240 --> 02:42:26,760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasi hirap kami,

3449
02:42:27,260 --> 02:42:31,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay ang right of way for water detention facilities.

3450
02:42:31,120 --> 02:42:33,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi ang sikit na po ng Metro Manila,

3451
02:42:33,700 --> 02:42:34,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: mahirap na pong mag-construct.

3452
02:42:35,240 --> 02:42:39,340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, kailangan po talaga nating maging mas creative.

3453
02:42:39,920 --> 02:42:41,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan pong gamitin ang imbawa,

3454
02:42:41,400 --> 02:42:42,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung ating mga open spaces,

3455
02:42:43,020 --> 02:42:44,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung mga parks,

3456
02:42:44,920 --> 02:42:47,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung papayag po yung mga golf course,

3457
02:42:47,760 --> 02:42:49,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung papayag po yung mga open field,

3458
02:42:51,220 --> 02:42:54,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasi kailangan po talaga malakihang mga detention facilities.

3459
02:42:54,860 --> 02:42:56,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And given the volume of water

3460
02:42:56,780 --> 02:43:00,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na bumabagsak po sa Metro Manila every year.

3461
02:43:00,820 --> 02:43:03,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, we want to do it.

3462
02:43:03,560 --> 02:43:05,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po talagang gawin.

3463
02:43:05,120 --> 02:43:08,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero right of way po talaga ang malaking problema.

3464
02:43:09,020 --> 02:43:09,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Gago na sa NCR.

3465
02:43:10,320 --> 02:43:11,020
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Salamat, Secretary.

3466
02:43:11,540 --> 02:43:14,020
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Yan din ang sinabi ko kasi ang problema mo talaga,

3467
02:43:14,020 --> 02:43:16,060
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: yung behavioral, environmental, historical.

3468
02:43:16,500 --> 02:43:19,100
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kaya sa amin sa Paranaque, asinan po dati yan eh.

3469
02:43:19,720 --> 02:43:21,600
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kaya iba po yung soil structure namin.

3470
02:43:21,720 --> 02:43:23,740
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kaya hirap talaga.

3471
02:43:23,800 --> 02:43:25,060
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kumbaga, kailangan mo talaga.

3472
02:43:25,220 --> 02:43:28,140
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Tignan din yung historical data.

3473
02:43:28,480 --> 02:43:32,940
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Sabi nga ni Kong kanina na kailangan,

3474
02:43:32,940 --> 02:43:35,360
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: tignan mo talaga yung background din,

3475
02:43:35,380 --> 02:43:36,480
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: yung science-based talaga.

3476
02:43:36,620 --> 02:43:38,160
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kaya yun nga yung approach na ano.

3477
02:43:38,940 --> 02:43:40,560
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Panghuli na lang, Secretary Vins,

3478
02:43:41,360 --> 02:43:44,200
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: kasi kaya namin nabanggit yung mga nabanggit namin,

3479
02:43:44,720 --> 02:43:48,360
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: kasi patapos na rin yung JICA-funded na Manggahan control gate structure.

3480
02:43:49,720 --> 02:43:50,960
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Ang outfall niyan sa Laguna Divide.

3481
02:43:52,160 --> 02:43:53,840
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: So, nandyan yung area namin.

3482
02:43:54,160 --> 02:43:57,360
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Tatamaan ng Las Piñas, tatamaan ng Mundinlupa, tatamaan ng Paranaque.

3483
02:43:57,380 --> 02:44:00,620
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kaya tinatanong ko na rin kanina yung Paranaque spillway.

3484
02:44:00,680 --> 02:44:07,100
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Dahil pag na ito, yung buhos ng tubig ng Marikina, doon na papunta sa amin eh.

3485
02:44:07,120 --> 02:44:11,400
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: So, ang sa akin lang, hanggat maaari, kung masimulan,

3486
02:44:11,400 --> 02:44:15,300
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: gaya na sinabi ng Pangulo, kung masimulan na natin yung Paranaque spillway,

3487
02:44:16,140 --> 02:44:20,680
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: kahit pa ano, mabawas na kami ng ano, magkaka-count down kami ng 10 years

3488
02:44:20,680 --> 02:44:22,080
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: bago at least matapos na yan.

3489
02:44:23,320 --> 02:44:24,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tama po, Mr. Chairman.

3490
02:44:24,800 --> 02:44:27,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung Paranaque spillway po talaga ay critical diyan.

3491
02:44:27,460 --> 02:44:34,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil yan po talaga ang magpuprovide ng exit sa tubig sa Laguna Lake papunta sa Manila Bay.

3492
02:44:34,760 --> 02:44:38,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po talaga, pag natapos na po yung lahat ng proyekto natin na JICA-funded,

3493
02:44:38,880 --> 02:44:45,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: lalo na sa Marikina area, eh talaga po, at sa western Metro Manila,

3494
02:44:45,340 --> 02:44:48,420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: diyan po sa Laguna Divide po, lahat ng bagsak ng tubig.

3495
02:44:48,460 --> 02:44:50,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, critical po talaga ang Paranaque spillway.

3496
02:44:50,760 --> 02:44:51,720
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Kong Brian.

3497
02:44:52,700 --> 02:45:02,960
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Last na lang po, Mr. Chair. Papasalamat lang po ko, Secretary, for all the efforts you are doing, not just for the city of Paranaque but also all over the country.

3498
02:45:03,120 --> 02:45:12,340
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Nakikita namin yung sipag mo, yung pagsasaga mo, yung inidad mo dahil sa trabaho mong to.

3499
02:45:12,680 --> 02:45:29,100
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kami, ito, kabatchmate ko si Secretary Vince sa pagpasok sa gobyerno at nakita ko, simula bata pa ko, masipag na ko talaga siya and I appreciate your efforts, not just for everybody but for the whole country. Maraming salamat, sir.

3500
02:45:29,340 --> 02:45:29,960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Maraming salamat po.

3501
02:45:30,020 --> 02:45:37,720
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you. Next, from the minority, Congresswoman Renee Ko.

3502
02:45:42,680 --> 02:45:46,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you po, Mr. Chair, at magandang hapon po sa

3503
02:45:46,540 --> 02:45:49,100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Department of Public Works and Highways.

3504
02:45:50,220 --> 02:46:17,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro magtatanong po muna ako at baha na naman at marami na naman po muling mga iba't ibang repairs and nakita nga natin last year na yung flood control scandal, marami pong mga contractors, questionable yung backgrounds, may ilan po dyan, may promise na titignan kung sila po ay qualified or hindi na magtuloy-tuloy

3505
02:46:17,320 --> 02:46:29,160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ayaw natin na mapunta yung budget natin sa isang contractor na hindi naman po qualified or nakapaghawak ng mga fake, substandard, ghost flood control projects.

3506
02:46:29,160 --> 02:46:46,760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So may I ask, Mr. Chair, Good Secretary, ilang contractors at DPWH project engineers po ba ang formal na na-blacklisted, pinarusahan, o na-demote ang ratings sa nakalipas na dalawang taon dahil sa substandard na kalsada at flood control projects?

3507
02:46:46,760 --> 02:46:49,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Batay sa Quality Assurance Unit Reports.

3508
02:46:54,500 --> 02:47:12,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, kagaya po nung nasabi kanina, there are 12 contractors that have been blacklisted already. These have all been subject... nasa Ombudsman na po ang mga, lahat ng impormasyon nitong mga ito, marami na pong na-file-an ng kaso at meron pa, according to Ombudsman Remulla po, ay marami pang parating.

3509
02:47:13,060 --> 02:47:21,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In terms of DPWH personnel, mahigit isandaan na po ang either na suspend, natanggal.

3510
02:47:21,260 --> 02:47:22,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At nakasuhan na.

3511
02:47:25,120 --> 02:47:29,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At meron pa po kaming mga i-announce sa mga susunod na linggo na next batch.

3512
02:47:29,840 --> 02:47:33,860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maari din po bang ma-transmit through this committee yung listahan na ito?

3513
02:47:34,120 --> 02:47:43,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Iyan po. Papalaga po namin exacto yung mga pangagan at mga kumpanya na nakasuhan at na-refer sa ombudsman.

3514
02:47:44,460 --> 02:47:51,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi ko po alam kung natanong na kanina pero last year din napatampok na kailangan ng

3515
02:47:51,120 --> 02:47:58,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Master Plan for Flood Control, particularly sa Metro Manila pero sana sa buong Pilipinas. May progress na po ba doon?

3516
02:47:58,900 --> 02:48:02,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Maraming salamat po, Kong Renee.

3517
02:48:04,040 --> 02:48:13,600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nasabi po kanina na ang NCR Master Plan, updating of the NCR Master Plan will be completed by early next year or end of this year.

3518
02:48:13,600 --> 02:48:21,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero in the meantime po, kasi hindi naman po tayong, hindi gagalaw, no, dahil grabe po yung baha sa NCR,

3519
02:48:21,420 --> 02:48:30,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ginagamit po natin ngayon at nakikipag-coordinate po tayo sa iba't ibang mga LGUs sa kanilang local drainage master plans

3520
02:48:30,480 --> 02:48:38,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po, like you said po, hindi katulad nung dati na meron po mga proyekto na lang na pinuponduan at iniimplement na walang plano,

3521
02:48:39,020 --> 02:48:46,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ito po ay naka-coordinate na po sa mga current LGU Master Plans habang po hinihintay natin yung final NCR Master Plan.

3522
02:48:47,600 --> 02:48:51,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ganon din po ang ginagawa natin dun sa mga iba't ibang major river basins.

3523
02:48:51,420 --> 02:48:52,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Master Plans.

3524
02:48:52,080 --> 02:48:58,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nagkaroon po ako ng opportunity, Mr. Chair, na mag-interpelate din sa COA kahapon.

3525
02:48:59,860 --> 02:49:13,980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Na-mention po nila na actually since 2016 pa daw po, fin-lag na po nila sa DPWH na in their audits of the projects and flood control mechanisms na dumadaan sa kanila,

3526
02:49:14,080 --> 02:49:16,940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dapat may Master Plan. 2016 pa daw po.

3527
02:49:17,080 --> 02:49:20,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito ibig sabihin 10 years have passed since they've flagged that and

3528
02:49:20,900 --> 02:49:26,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Up to now ay wala pa rin Master Plan that we can speak of.

3529
02:49:26,180 --> 02:49:30,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano po bang timeline para po matapos yung mga Master Plan?

3530
02:49:30,960 --> 02:49:39,240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At siguro baka pwede pong matanong din, meron po bang any efforts na magkaroon ng Master Plan prior po to last year?

3531
02:49:40,920 --> 02:49:45,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron naman pong Master Plans ng lahat ng 18 major river basins.

3532
02:49:46,040 --> 02:49:49,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Isusumiti po namin ito sa inyo at sa komite.

3533
02:49:49,120 --> 02:49:51,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Marami po dito ay kailangan i-update.

3534
02:49:51,020 --> 02:50:05,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero ang latest po natin, dahil nga po pinapamadali ko po ang mga ito, is by next year, mid-next year, updated na po lahat itong 18 major river basin Master Plans na ito.

3535
02:50:05,260 --> 02:50:09,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At magre-report po kami agad sa Kongreso sa status po nito.

3536
02:50:10,480 --> 02:50:12,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At isusumiti po natin yung mga Master Plans.

3537
02:50:13,060 --> 02:50:17,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, syempre gets naman natin na nag-iiba ang mga daloy ng ating mga ilog, etc.

3538
02:50:17,840 --> 02:50:20,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero fin-lag naman po yan ng COA noon pa.

3539
02:50:20,620 --> 02:50:31,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dahil po, then and up until now, may identified silang mga flood control projects na taliwas dun sa kanilang purpose yung nagagawa nila.

3540
02:50:31,260 --> 02:50:33,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: They were sent flood instead.

3541
02:50:33,420 --> 02:50:39,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po bang identification yung DPWH ng aling bang projects yung yun yung nangyayari?

3542
02:50:39,140 --> 02:50:44,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kaya po, kailan ba ito pwede matanggal or ma-overhaul para hindi na po nagagawa yun?

3543
02:50:44,680 --> 02:50:48,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron po. In fact, kasama po yan sa ongoing audit natin with the other investigators.

3544
02:50:50,580 --> 02:50:55,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Investigative agencies, NBI, CIDG, DOJ.

3545
02:50:56,870 --> 02:51:03,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And in fact, meron na po kaming mga napatunayan na hindi masyadong nakakatulong.

3546
02:51:03,300 --> 02:51:07,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And in fact, tinanggal na po namin yung iba dito.

3547
02:51:08,250 --> 02:51:15,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At meron din po kaming mga na-identify na mga hindi namang kailangang ituloy na kahit na nagawa.

3548
02:51:15,960 --> 02:51:21,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po, yung sa Bungabong sa Mindoro.

3549
02:51:21,480 --> 02:51:25,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero, ito pong subject ng kaso ni former congressman Zaldico.

3550
02:51:25,780 --> 02:51:30,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yan po, ang recommendation na po ng ating experts ay hindi na po ituloy yun.

3551
02:51:31,180 --> 02:51:40,960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, ito din po ang basis ng kaso ni former congressman Zaldico na ngayon ay pending sa Sandigan Bayan.

3552
02:51:41,060 --> 02:51:42,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, tuloy-tuloy po kami dito.

3553
02:51:42,360 --> 02:51:47,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, tuloy, gano po kaya kabilis pwedeng matanggal yung ganitong mga proyekto?

3554
02:51:47,540 --> 02:51:49,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dahil nakakapinsalan na sila, di ba?

3555
02:51:49,620 --> 02:51:50,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po.

3556
02:51:51,940 --> 02:51:56,440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po gano'ng kadali, Mr. Chairman, Madam Congressman.

3557
02:51:56,600 --> 02:52:04,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po, kailangan po ito talaga ma-establish muna na ito'y hindi nakakabuti o ito'y hindi kailangan.

3558
02:52:04,320 --> 02:52:11,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po itong mabigyan ng proper COA clearances para either hindi na ituloy or gibain.

3559
02:52:12,460 --> 02:52:15,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi alam nyo naman po na straight to po ang COA dyan.

3560
02:52:15,900 --> 02:52:20,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po tayo pwedeng basta-basta nalang magigiba ng mga proyektong pinagkagalagay.

3561
02:52:21,600 --> 02:52:22,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Gastos na ng pera ng taong bayan.

3562
02:52:22,860 --> 02:52:29,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tuloy-tuloy po kami dito at nakakainip lang po talaga at medyo masalimut yung proseso pero tuloy-tuloy po kami.

3563
02:52:29,480 --> 02:52:38,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung maaari pong masumite rin po sa komite yung mga na-identify na pong mga proyekto na nakakapinsala at pwede po at sana naka-line up na tanggalin na po.

3564
02:52:40,680 --> 02:52:42,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: May IAS report tayo dyan?

3565
02:52:43,160 --> 02:52:46,100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, magsasubmit po kami, Mr. Chairman.

3566
02:52:46,300 --> 02:52:46,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Madam Congressman.

3567
02:52:47,280 --> 02:52:49,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: My next line of questioning naman po.

3568
02:52:50,120 --> 02:52:54,140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, tungkol naman po sa ating mga pedestrians and commuters.

3569
02:52:55,180 --> 02:53:01,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can I ask po, magkano po ba ang opisyal na kabuoang halaga ng bike lane project for 2027?

3570
02:53:03,720 --> 02:53:05,900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: EDSA pedestrianization and bike lane project.

3571
02:53:10,000 --> 02:53:15,300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito pong expansion ng pedestrian walkways natin along EDSA.

3572
02:53:15,400 --> 02:53:21,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang total project cost po nito ay 6 billion pesos.

3573
02:53:21,440 --> 02:53:22,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: End to end na po yan.

3574
02:53:23,340 --> 02:53:41,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po yung original na 17 billion peso EDSA rehab project na pinababa po natin ang cost at dati po kasi wala pong pagpapalawak ng pedestrian lane yung original EDSA rehab project.

3575
02:53:41,520 --> 02:53:52,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero pinadagdag po natin yan dahil talaga pong kailangan i-prioritize na finally ng DPWH ang pedestrians at ang commuters at ang minimum pedestrian width.

3576
02:53:52,860 --> 02:54:02,520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na po natin for EDSA will be a minimum of 2.8 meters with a maximum of, in some areas, 5 meters.

3577
02:54:02,920 --> 02:54:04,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Aabot po ng 5 meters.

3578
02:54:04,820 --> 02:54:14,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dati po, ang average pedestrian walkway width po sa EDSA ay parang nasa wala pang isang metro.

3579
02:54:15,220 --> 02:54:17,800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In some cases, 0.3 meters lang po.

3580
02:54:17,900 --> 02:54:19,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, maraking bagay po ito.

3581
02:54:20,580 --> 02:54:22,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At nakikita naman po natin ang...

3582
02:54:22,480 --> 02:54:27,200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang nagiging epekto po sa paggamit ng ating mga commuters at pedestrians.

3583
02:54:27,740 --> 02:54:39,340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Opo, dahil po, according nga po sa Philippine Development Plan, up to 2023 to 2028, pedestrians and cyclists will be accorded the highest priority in the hierarchy of road users.

3584
02:54:39,860 --> 02:54:45,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero, and pwede na po siguro i-flash yung slide na gusto ko pong makita ng publiko.

3585
02:54:45,740 --> 02:54:50,940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: This is from the Manila Bike Community.

3586
02:54:51,500 --> 02:54:52,660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito po ay...

3587
02:54:52,660 --> 02:54:55,640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung supposedly, yung...

3588
02:54:57,240 --> 02:55:01,320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung improved na bike lanes that in-implement this year.

3589
02:55:01,620 --> 02:55:08,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And so, kung titignan natin, tinanggal din po yung mga bollards, tinanggal po yung mga iba't-ibang protections for bike lanes.

3590
02:55:08,520 --> 02:55:09,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At sobrang liit.

3591
02:55:09,780 --> 02:55:11,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: To the point na, asan ba yung bike lane?

3592
02:55:11,860 --> 02:55:13,000
