Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, salamat po. Pero, any local ordinance, I became a mayor also,

5118
04:01:33,860 --> 04:01:38,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pag magawa po tayo ng batas locally, we cannot supersede any national law.

5119
04:01:38,540 --> 04:01:39,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tama po.

5120
04:01:39,360 --> 04:01:40,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, even confiscation.

5121
04:01:40,840 --> 04:01:43,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: impounding, nangyayari po sa amin yan.

5122
04:01:43,040 --> 04:01:46,100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang kumukuha po is Sagip Kalikasan Task Force.

5123
04:01:46,100 --> 04:01:50,400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And para makuha nyo is mag-file po kayo ng kaso po sa korte.

5124
04:01:50,400 --> 04:01:55,560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And alam naman po natin yung justice system natin, pag-file pa lang, pagbayad, etc.

5125
04:01:55,560 --> 04:02:02,240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, with regards to this matter, medyo malala na po yung nangyayari sa amin.

5126
04:02:02,240 --> 04:02:09,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: In fact, may isa pong, I won't mention the name, but may isa pong contractor, anim na bako na po, ang kinuha.

5127
04:02:10,760 --> 04:02:16,720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil po gumagawa sa aming boulevard, and that is the Partido Boulevard along the coastline.

5128
04:02:17,980 --> 04:02:27,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, siyempre po may bako ka para gumawa ng pundasyon, kailangan pong gamitin yun, kinukonfiscate po yun.

5129
04:02:27,700 --> 04:02:32,280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, I don't know, this is beyond politics, sir.

5130
04:02:32,280 --> 04:02:39,100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, I don't want you to be involved in local politics, but this is a national project already.

5131
04:02:39,100 --> 04:02:50,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: There are abuses of Sangib Kalikasan Task Force, na ang alam ko po talaga, even DNR, not only DNR, but the PNP, it's a composite team.

5132
04:02:50,040 --> 04:02:56,860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dapat po deputize ka, kasama po yung DNR, pag-implement, and even po ang ating kapolisan.

5133
04:02:56,860 --> 04:03:02,200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, thank you, at least you are very well aware of the situation.

5134
04:03:02,540 --> 04:03:05,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Lalo na po, minsan mga line canal, re-blocking.

5135
04:03:08,360 --> 04:03:17,580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Minsan po, pag sa amin nag-landslide, may landslide, pag nag-clearing ka ng daan, tinatawag na po yun, quarrying.

5136
04:03:18,540 --> 04:03:20,400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, that is the situation.

5137
04:03:20,400 --> 04:03:25,940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I don't know kung sa amin lang pong distrito yan, or sa buong pong Pilipinas.

5138
04:03:25,940 --> 04:03:32,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, I hope we can stop the abuse na ginagawa po, na nangyayari po sa amin.

5139
04:03:32,040 --> 04:03:34,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, dumudulog lang po kami sa inyo, sir.

5140
04:03:34,340 --> 04:03:37,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, makakaasa po kayo, Mr. Chairman.

5141
04:03:37,260 --> 04:03:39,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi, ayaw na ayaw po natin.

5142
04:03:39,580 --> 04:03:43,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung nade-delay ang mga proyekto kasi kailangan-kailangan po ito ng mga kababayan natin.

5143
04:03:43,740 --> 04:03:48,940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Chair. That's it. I'm fully supportive of your leadership.

5144
04:03:48,940 --> 04:03:49,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you very much.

5145
04:03:49,880 --> 04:03:50,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you Cong Arnie, thank you,

5146
04:03:50,520 --> 04:03:52,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman.

5147
04:03:52,920 --> 04:03:56,020
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, thank you, Kong Arnie.

