04:05:43,620 --> 04:05:46,660
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: na yung with chopper, Secretary.

5166
04:05:47,400 --> 04:05:49,300
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Ayon ang malaking pasalamat namin sa inyo.

5167
04:05:49,380 --> 04:05:54,040
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Ang effort po ninyo, effort po ni Usec. Calima at mga kawani

5168
04:05:54,040 --> 04:05:56,040
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: ng taga

