Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: 1 billion and above.

5252
04:14:10,019 --> 04:14:10,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo

5253
04:14:10,576 --> 04:14:15,100
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: I actually ask this, no, um, Sec, because I really appreciate the direction of the department

5254
04:14:15,520 --> 04:14:20,460
