Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tungkol naman pala ito, maiba ko naman, ito tungkol sa...

5419
04:28:18,240 --> 04:28:38,380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Nabasa ko rin rito, gusto po nyo, tungkol dun sa clustering ng school, di ba ngayon ay tuloy-tuloy ang, alam naman natin ang shortage ng classroom, more or less from 160,000 ngayon 150,000 na.

5420
04:28:39,520 --> 04:28:55,160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang gusto po naman natin kasi mapabilis natin na magamit ng mga syudyante, sapagkat nakikita naman po natin kasi, Mr. Chair, Apu, Sekretary, yung mga amphitheater sa mga school ay nagagamit ng halos 6 na section, 7 sections, pero ngayon ay nababawasan na.

5421
04:28:55,320 --> 04:29:03,720
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ngayon ang tanong po natin, paano ba yung clustering na ginagawa po ngayon by region?

5422
04:29:03,920 --> 04:29:08,360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi may nagparating din na isang malaking problem.

5423
04:29:08,360 --> 04:29:23,540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa isang project na apat na distrito magpagsasama-sama, apos i-implement ng nag-iisa na mayroong, sa isang project na mayroong 57 na sites, ano ho bang masasabi nyo rito? Mas mapapabilis ba siya o ano ho mas maganda?

5424
04:29:23,640 --> 04:29:36,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, ang ginagawa po natin ngayon, parang nga po naghanap tayo ng mga panibagong paraan para mapabilis ang pagpapagawa ng classroom, meron po tayong ginagawang clustering, pero site per site.

5425
04:29:36,680 --> 04:29:37,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ibig sabihin po, akimbawa.

5426
04:29:38,300 --> 04:29:41,820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron pong mga site na mahihirap puntahan.

5427
04:29:42,680 --> 04:29:45,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yun po, ika-cluster po natin doon para masigurado po natin.

5428
04:29:45,660 --> 04:29:50,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na talaga pong magagawa ng mabilis yung mga areas na yun.

5429
04:29:51,840 --> 04:29:56,740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Importante din po yung clustering dahil po pag nagkoconsolidate po tayo,

5430
04:29:56,780 --> 04:30:03,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: then mas na i-insure po natin yung bilis at yung quality din po ng pagpapagawa.

5431
04:30:03,860 --> 04:30:06,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero depende din po ito sa mga site.

5432
04:30:07,620 --> 04:30:10,340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po kung merong mga area na mountainous,

5433
04:30:10,360 --> 04:30:14,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: halimbawa po sa Cordillera po, dun sa area po ni Congressman Domogan.

5434
04:30:15,100 --> 04:30:16,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung mga last miles.

5435
04:30:16,300 --> 04:30:16,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung mga last miles.

5436
04:30:17,060 --> 04:30:19,800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pwede po natin i-cluster yung mga marayong lugar

5437
04:30:19,800 --> 04:30:27,100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po mas madaling maabot ng mga kontratista yung mga area at sanay sa lugar.

5438
04:30:27,560 --> 04:30:33,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So very ano naman po ito, very, wala naman pong hard and fast na rule dito

5439
04:30:33,260 --> 04:30:40,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at nag-a-adjust lang po tayo with the end goal na mapabilis at ma-insure na maayos ang pagkagawa.

5440
04:30:40,160 --> 04:30:42,360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At saka magamit po agad ng ating mga…

5441
04:30:42,360 --> 04:30:43,460
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At magagamit po agad ng ating mga…

5442
04:30:43,460 --> 04:30:44,700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi yun po usually.

5443
04:30:44,700 --> 04:30:45,920
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Nagiging problema po.

5444
04:30:46,200 --> 04:30:48,800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sana matignan nyo, ma-revisit nyo lang po, Aposagatari.

5445
04:30:49,740 --> 04:30:50,680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Last question.

5446
04:30:50,680 --> 04:30:51,800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ito na po, Aposagatari.

5447
04:30:54,940 --> 04:30:58,100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ito, napag-usapan po natin parate na tungkol po dun sa repair,

5448
04:30:58,720 --> 04:31:02,360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tungkol sa constructions, ng maharlika natin, yung daan 001,

5449
04:31:03,120 --> 04:31:05,060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at saka yung mga iba pa po.

5450
04:31:05,980 --> 04:31:09,320
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang isa po sa hindi po natin napapansin, Mr. Chair, Aposagatari,

5451
04:31:11,060 --> 04:31:13,040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tungkol po dun sa mga overloading,

5452
04:31:14,440 --> 04:31:17,880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh, ang totoo niya, kahit gaano kalalim po yung gawin natin,

5453
04:31:17,920 --> 04:31:21,120
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: gaano kakapal ka ko sana yung mga 311 natin na yan,

5454
04:31:22,060 --> 04:31:24,840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: PCCP natin na yan, eh, wala pong mangyayari dyan.

5455
04:31:25,640 --> 04:31:29,400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Eh, hindi po ba, andyan naman yung mga track scale natin, wing scale natin,

5456
04:31:29,420 --> 04:31:36,100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na ang may saklaw dyan, dapat PMP, DPWH, at saka LTO.

5457
04:31:36,340 --> 04:31:42,200
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang tanong po dyan, ilan na po ba yung medyo na…

5458
04:31:43,000 --> 04:31:46,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nabigyan po natin ng pansin, Mr. Chair, Aposagatari.

5459
04:31:48,160 --> 04:31:51,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi sira po kasi ng sirekal sa atin, tapos repair naman tayo ng repair.

5460
04:31:51,780 --> 04:31:53,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Di ba magastos, di po ba?

5461
04:31:54,060 --> 04:31:56,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraking problema po talaga ito, Mr. Chairman.

5462
04:31:57,060 --> 04:32:00,760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact, nung ako po yung nasa Department of Transportation pa,

5463
04:32:00,920 --> 04:32:04,300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: talaga pong sakit ng ulo po ito,

5464
04:32:04,300 --> 04:32:09,340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil it's really a big enforcement problem.

5465
04:32:11,120 --> 04:32:11,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Iyan â€™yung po.

5466
04:32:11,920 --> 04:32:13,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At tuloy-tuloy po ang pagdulog natin.

5467
04:32:13,920 --> 04:32:18,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kay Secretary Janvic, kay Chief PNP, at sa ating mga LGUs

5468
04:32:18,480 --> 04:32:23,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na talaga mag-impose po tayo ng strict enforcement nung ating overloading.

5469
04:32:23,540 --> 04:32:24,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Grabe po talaga.

5470
04:32:24,340 --> 04:32:28,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, sasabihin ko lang po, si Congressman Tan po,

5471
04:32:28,580 --> 04:32:31,520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: taga Isabela at sa Northern Luzon,

5472
04:32:31,920 --> 04:32:35,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Diyos ko po, yung pong ating mga tulay dyan, number one victim po

5473
04:32:35,840 --> 04:32:38,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng mga overloaded na track.

5474
04:32:39,320 --> 04:32:42,500
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Talaga pong kailangan po talaga ma-enforce natin ang mabuti.

5475
04:32:42,520 --> 04:32:44,000
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mga 60 tons nga yun, Secretary.

5476
04:32:44,440 --> 04:32:45,840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Minsan po, 100 tons.

5477
04:32:46,160 --> 04:32:48,600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung pong sumira sa pigatan sa kagayaan.

5478
04:32:48,600 --> 04:32:51,440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Parang 80 to 100 tons po yun, na dalawa.

5479
04:32:51,900 --> 04:32:52,380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Opo.

5480
04:32:52,620 --> 04:32:56,560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya yun ho, kaya sana ay ma-impose natin,

5481
04:32:56,680 --> 04:32:59,180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: strictly ma-impose natin para at least

5482
04:33:01,100 --> 04:33:02,980
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ma-protectionan natin yung kalasada natin.

5483
04:33:02,980 --> 04:33:06,800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Dudulog po tayo sa ating law enforcement agencies

5484
04:33:06,800 --> 04:33:07,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po magtulog natin.

5485
04:33:07,560 --> 04:33:11,160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Para at least, hindi masayang ang pera ng taong bayan.

5486
04:33:11,160 --> 04:33:12,520
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kahit anong gawin natin,

5487
04:33:12,520 --> 04:33:15,780
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kahit anong perang i-gastusin natin,

5488
04:33:15,780 --> 04:33:20,700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kung di ho natin naman talaga i-limit yung load ng mga sasakyan.

5489
04:33:20,840 --> 04:33:22,280
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At sasak natin masisira natin.

5490
04:33:22,840 --> 04:33:24,300
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Again and again, Sal, thank you po.

5491
04:33:24,660 --> 04:33:27,620
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Maraming salamat sa tulong ng DPT Palit sa atin

5492
04:33:27,620 --> 04:33:29,300
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at sa ating lahat. Maraming maraming salamat.

5493
04:33:30,040 --> 04:33:33,600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Com. Joseph, for the very short questions.

5494
04:33:36,140 --> 04:33:37,820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Pero ang galing, ang galing ng mga tanong.

5495
04:33:38,280 --> 04:33:39,800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, very interesting.

5496
04:33:42,020 --> 04:33:42,540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Secretary,

5497
04:33:42,540 --> 04:33:44,540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: malapit na. Malapit na tayong matapos.

5498
04:33:45,140 --> 04:33:45,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Okay lang po.

5499
04:33:46,720 --> 04:33:48,480
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung hindi, magdadagdagan ito.

5500
04:33:49,380 --> 04:33:54,840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Well, the next, the next to interpellate,

5501
04:33:54,840 --> 04:33:58,820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: our senior deputy speaker, Dinan Hernandez.

5502
04:33:59,500 --> 04:34:01,820
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Hindi po ako magtatanong.

5503
04:34:01,820 --> 04:34:04,100
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Kaya lang sa tagal ng tanong ni Kong Joseph,

5504
04:34:04,100 --> 04:34:05,860
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: kala ko telenovela eh.

5505
04:34:06,580 --> 04:34:09,820
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, actually, nandito lang po ako para magpasalamat,

5506
04:34:10,240 --> 04:34:13,640
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: i-congratulate si Secretary Vince under his watch.

5507
04:34:14,270 --> 04:34:16,220
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Hindi po biro yung pinagdaanan ninyo.

5508
04:34:16,510 --> 04:34:18,720
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, palakpakan niyo po yung mga sarili ninyo.

5509
04:34:18,960 --> 04:34:21,980
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: DPWH, you deserve a round of applause.

5510
04:34:23,640 --> 04:34:29,720
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Kasi, ah, I was thinking nung nag-umpisa si Sec. Vince,

5511
04:34:29,800 --> 04:34:31,940
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: napakahirap nung pagdadaanan niya.

5512
04:34:32,740 --> 04:34:35,680
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Whether ma-accept ng buong DP institution,

5513
04:34:35,680 --> 04:34:37,400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: the reforms that he introduced,

5514
04:34:39,380 --> 04:34:41,400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: galing din po ako sa gobyerno.

5515
04:34:42,280 --> 04:34:43,660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: It's so hard to introduce reforms.

5516
04:34:43,980 --> 04:34:49,800
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: But, ah, I must say na at this time, medyo the dust settle.

5517
04:34:50,220 --> 04:34:52,360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Medyo tanggap na po yung mga reforms.

5518
04:34:52,760 --> 04:34:55,200
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Tuloy-tuloy na yung trabaho ng DPWH.

5519
04:34:55,200 --> 04:34:59,840
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And then, ah, si Mr. Actionman, no?

5520
04:35:00,450 --> 04:35:02,360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Mr. Actionman na tawag natin kay Sec. Vince.

5521
04:35:03,760 --> 04:35:08,340
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: O kaya huwag kayong magtataka na mas mukha siyang matanda sa akin.

5522
04:35:09,270 --> 04:35:11,440
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Mas bata ho ako. Mas bata ho siya sa akin.

5523
04:35:11,580 --> 04:35:13,320
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero dahil sa kakaikot niya.

5524
04:35:13,580 --> 04:35:17,760
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Actually, pag pinapanood ko siya, parang nakikita ko na yung sitwasyon ng buong Pilipinas.

5525
04:35:18,900 --> 04:35:20,740
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And, hindi, sa totoo lang to, no?

5526
04:35:22,360 --> 04:35:25,540
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, binibisita niya yung mga lugar na hopeless.

5527
04:35:26,720 --> 04:35:28,540
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero nagagawa ng paraan.

5528
04:35:28,540 --> 04:35:30,900
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ibig sabihin, walang perang nasasayang.

5529
04:35:31,380 --> 04:35:33,640
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Witness po ako niyan doon sa lugar ko, no?

5530
04:35:35,400 --> 04:35:37,960
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, used to be my district. Nasira yung daan.

5531
04:35:39,560 --> 04:35:40,800
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Eh, niyaya po niya akong lumipad.

5532
04:35:41,040 --> 04:35:44,420
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, sinamaan ko po siya at nakita ko yung, nakita niya yung lugar.

5533
04:35:44,760 --> 04:35:46,060
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Talagang in action, no?

5534
04:35:46,900 --> 04:35:50,420
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Dinala ko siya doon sa ibang lugar na kailangan tapusin.

5535
04:35:54,280 --> 04:35:56,480
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, fortunately, ah, nabigyan niya naman ng pondo na

5536
04:35:56,480 --> 04:36:02,660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: he made sure na yung mga nabisita niya at kailangang ayusin, naiayos, no?

5537
04:36:03,060 --> 04:36:05,220
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So I'll give it to Sec. Vince,

5538
04:36:05,220 --> 04:36:08,660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: na sana tuloy-tuloy na ito.

5539
04:36:08,760 --> 04:36:13,400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: At alam ko naman, under your watch, wala nang perang masasayang.

5540
04:36:13,440 --> 04:36:16,020
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Wala nang ghost project, wala nang substandard.

5541
04:36:16,460 --> 04:36:27,660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Everybody now is aware na ang publiko ay talagang nagbabantay na bawat piso na mapupunta sa DP ay pakikinabangan ng taong bayan.

5542
04:36:27,700 --> 04:36:31,260
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And I'm, ako mismo, I'm confident, no?

5543
04:36:31,380 --> 04:36:34,360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Hindi lang naman ako, maraming namang nakaka-witness dyan.

5544
04:36:34,820 --> 04:36:36,400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Na, ah, pasensya ka na, Sec. Vince.

5545
04:36:37,220 --> 04:36:41,480
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Tuwing budget, feeling ng lahat, savior of the universe ka.

5546
04:36:42,000 --> 04:36:44,560
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero alam naman natin, hindi naman kaya ang lahat.

5547
04:36:44,840 --> 04:36:54,480
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Doon lang sa talagang, ah, tama, practical, reasonable, and, ah, napaka-importanting project na pakinabagan ng taong bayan.

5548
04:36:54,580 --> 04:36:57,700
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, again, congratulations to the DP family.

5549
04:36:58,540 --> 04:37:01,020
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, I hope you continue all these reforms.

5550
04:37:01,020 --> 04:37:03,140
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And, ah, mapakita sa publiko na,

5551
04:37:03,140 --> 04:37:07,800
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: karapat-dapat na pagkatiwalaan ang Department of Public Works and Highways.

5552
04:37:07,960 --> 04:37:08,560
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Maraming salamat.

5553
04:37:12,460 --> 04:37:14,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ah, Mr. Chairman, maraming...

5554
04:37:14,140 --> 04:37:20,700
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Bago ko pala i-end yung speech ko, nagpapasalamat ako at sana huwag mo kalimutan ang distrito ko.

5555
04:37:21,840 --> 04:37:26,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Ah, Mr. Chairman, papasalamat po ako kay, ah, Senior Deputy Speaker.

5556
04:37:26,780 --> 04:37:33,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ah, basta po, with, with your support po, and, ah, lalong-lalo na po ang supporta ng Pangulo.

5557
04:37:33,540 --> 04:37:35,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Basta po, tuloy-tuloy po tayo.

5558
04:37:35,980 --> 04:37:37,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Habang buhay. Habang buhay po.

5559
04:37:37,780 --> 04:37:38,800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tuloy-tuloy tayo.

5560
04:37:39,540 --> 04:37:41,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, SDS Dinan.

5561
04:37:42,780 --> 04:37:46,340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, ah, Congressman Timothy Cayton.

5562
04:37:47,820 --> 04:37:49,880
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you so much, ah, Mr. Chairman.

5563
04:37:50,860 --> 04:37:54,660
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: I'll, I'll just make it, ah, short for our Secretary.

5564
04:37:54,660 --> 04:38:03,820
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: But, ah, before I begin, may commend the Department, once again, for the reforms na introduced,

5565
04:38:03,820 --> 04:38:06,820
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: especially, ah, the flood mitigation programs.

5566
04:38:06,820 --> 04:38:09,060
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: May saludo ko kami sa Departamento ho talaga.

5567
04:38:09,060 --> 04:38:13,060
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ako yung Congressman ng probinsya ng Nueva Vizcaya.

5568
04:38:13,060 --> 04:38:18,260
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And, ah, Nueva Vizcaya is known as the gateway of the Cagayan Valley

5569
04:38:18,880 --> 04:38:24,680
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Alam mo ninyo, the last budget deliberation, may request ho kami ng widening ng national roads.

5570
04:38:24,840 --> 04:38:29,220
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: At ongoing na ho siya. Thank you so much, ah, ah, Secretary, ah, ah, Vince.

5571
04:38:31,200 --> 04:38:35,700
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: But then, ah, our, ah, problem now.

5572
04:38:35,700 --> 04:38:47,080
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Is, ah, yun hung, ah, location kasi yun ng Nueva Vizcaya talagang, ah, marami hung cargo trucks.

5573
04:38:48,360 --> 04:38:49,960
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yeah, marami hung cargo trucks.

5574
04:38:49,960 --> 04:38:51,740
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: All through the region, ah, region.

5575
04:38:52,600 --> 04:38:56,100
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, we know the movement of goods is important to the economy.

5576
04:38:56,100 --> 04:39:00,600
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And continuous passage of heavy and potentially overloaded trucks.

5577
04:39:01,300 --> 04:39:04,780
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Also contributes to the premature deterioration.

5578
04:39:04,780 --> 04:39:06,680
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And wear and tear of our roads and bridges.

5579
04:39:07,820 --> 04:39:11,280
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Now, ah, ah, the way the public would see.

5580
04:39:11,520 --> 04:39:17,020
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Dahil hung, ah, ah, dahil sa mga overloads, yung mga trucks natin, overloading.

5581
04:39:17,480 --> 04:39:20,660
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Eh, makikita ng publiko na para ang bilis na masira yung roads.

5582
04:39:21,180 --> 04:39:26,760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And they would have the public opinion that's, ah, dahil ang bilis, is substandard.

