6746
05:15:20,540 --> 05:15:28,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Especially yung mga flood control projects that would require to,

6747
05:15:28,260 --> 05:15:31,940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: for example, yung mga slope protection sa mga rivers, sa mga creeks.

6748
05:15:32,000 --> 05:15:36,400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasi po, kuminsan yung mga program of work,

6749
05:15:36,500 --> 05:15:40,980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sa halip na lumaki yung mga natural waterways,

6750
05:15:41,060 --> 05:15:41,760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: lumiliit pa.

6751
05:15:42,590 --> 05:15:46,960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, hindi ba pwede na bukod sa pagpaplano,

6752
05:15:46,960 --> 05:15:50,020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: merong environmental impact assessment,

6753
05:15:50,240 --> 05:15:55,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: certain threshold nung mga proyekto na flood control?

6754
05:15:55,580 --> 05:15:57,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi ko naman sinasabi yung mga building.

6755
05:15:57,260 --> 05:15:58,220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Okay lang yun.

6756
05:15:58,220 --> 05:16:01,520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Basta pagdating dito sa, it would touch rivers,

6757
05:16:02,180 --> 05:16:06,720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung mga seashores,

6758
05:16:06,900 --> 05:16:09,700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: pagka may mga natural waterways,

6759
05:16:09,840 --> 05:16:11,260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: siguro po kailangan natin na,

6760
05:16:11,260 --> 05:16:15,740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: magkaroon ng environmental impact assessment

6761
05:16:15,740 --> 05:16:17,740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: before we can even proceed.

6762
05:16:17,740 --> 05:16:19,300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang maganda po rito,

6763
05:16:19,420 --> 05:16:22,440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: mas magiging efektibo yung proyekto

6764
05:16:22,440 --> 05:16:25,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: dahil makikita natin sa EIS

6765
05:16:25,140 --> 05:16:28,440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kung yung mga ilalagay nating mga facilities

6766
05:16:28,440 --> 05:16:33,860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ay angkop dun sa area.

6767
05:16:33,860 --> 05:16:35,060
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: For example,

6768
05:16:36,180 --> 05:16:39,000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: meron pong plano ang MMDA to put up

6769
05:16:40,040 --> 05:16:41,560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: giant or big

6770
05:16:41,560 --> 05:16:42,300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: cisterns,

6771
05:16:42,300 --> 05:16:44,980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: all over Metro Manila.

6772
05:16:45,060 --> 05:16:47,920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro po, dapat bago simulan yung proyekto na yun,

6773
05:16:48,680 --> 05:16:50,720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: merong environmental impact assessment.

6774
05:16:51,180 --> 05:16:51,600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, yun po.

6775
05:16:51,740 --> 05:16:54,460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sabi ko nga po, hindi naman for this year,

6776
05:16:54,620 --> 05:16:55,780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: alam po na wala na tayo,

6777
05:16:55,860 --> 05:16:57,860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: technically and politically,

6778
05:16:58,180 --> 05:17:01,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: hindi na realistic ngayon.

6779
05:17:01,140 --> 05:17:05,840
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Second, baka naman po po pwede magkaroon tayo ng

6780
05:17:05,840 --> 05:17:08,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: certain parameters,

6781
05:17:08,340 --> 05:17:09,900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: on determining,

6782
05:17:10,140 --> 05:17:12,960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: at for next year ha, hindi na ngayon.

6783
05:17:12,960 --> 05:17:15,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Technically, politically, hindi na pwede.

6784
05:17:15,340 --> 05:17:16,380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero next year,

6785
05:17:16,540 --> 05:17:19,000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: nakikita ko po kasi,

6786
05:17:19,000 --> 05:17:22,760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: merong isang distrito 10 billion ang allocation.

6787
05:17:22,760 --> 05:17:27,620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Merong isang distrito 200 billion ang allocation.

6788
05:17:27,620 --> 05:17:30,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro po, dapat kahit papano,

6789
05:17:30,140 --> 05:17:31,780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: hindi ko naman sinasabing dapat equal,

6790
05:17:31,780 --> 05:17:35,900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: dapat equitable yung distribution ng resources

6791
05:17:35,900 --> 05:17:39,560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: para equitable din ang pag-unlad nung bawat lugar.

6792
05:17:39,560 --> 05:17:43,480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, siguro, ano ba yung mga parameters na pwede?

6793
05:17:43,580 --> 05:17:45,020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Population, need,

6794
05:17:50,800 --> 05:17:53,360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung talagang pangangailangan,

6795
05:17:53,420 --> 05:17:54,300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung land area,

6796
05:17:54,780 --> 05:17:57,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung problem ng lugar.

6797
05:17:57,140 --> 05:17:59,240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro po, dapat meron tayong parameters,

6798
05:17:59,640 --> 05:18:00,740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: hindi lang,

6799
05:18:00,740 --> 05:18:04,400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ang nangyayari po kasi ngayon,

6800
05:18:04,400 --> 05:18:05,440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: whether we like it or not,

6801
05:18:05,580 --> 05:18:07,960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: para sa akin, yung allocations is political

6802
05:18:07,960 --> 05:18:09,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: rather than the need.

6803
05:18:09,340 --> 05:18:11,660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, baka po pwede po, by next year,

6804
05:18:11,800 --> 05:18:13,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kahit papano,

6805
05:18:13,580 --> 05:18:15,640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: January pa lang,

6806
05:18:15,820 --> 05:18:19,180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sinisimulan natin sa preparation

6807
05:18:19,700 --> 05:18:22,620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: o simulan pa lang ang budget process,

6808
05:18:23,700 --> 05:18:26,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ma-implement na po natin itong mga reforms na ito

6809
05:18:26,320 --> 05:18:30,600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sa mga proyekto ng DPWH.

6810
05:18:30,920 --> 05:18:31,380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Salamat po.

6811
05:18:32,200 --> 05:18:34,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, napakaganda po ng mga suggestions.

6812
05:18:34,620 --> 05:18:35,800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will definitely, ano po,

6813
05:18:35,800 --> 05:18:38,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: implement this.

6814
05:18:38,040 --> 05:18:40,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Gago na po yung environmental impact study.

6815
05:18:40,600 --> 05:18:41,900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po talaga yan,

6816
05:18:41,900 --> 05:18:44,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: especially for flood mitigation projects.

6817
05:18:44,620 --> 05:18:46,200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nakita ko po mismo yung

6818
05:18:48,540 --> 05:18:50,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pagpapag-iit ng mga waterway na ginawa

6819
05:18:51,080 --> 05:18:51,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nung nakaraan.

6820
05:18:51,580 --> 05:18:53,340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact, ang ginawa po namin ngayon,

6821
05:18:53,360 --> 05:18:55,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang ibawa sa Cebu at sa ibang mga area,

6822
05:18:55,840 --> 05:18:56,800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung pong dating pinag-iit,

6823
05:18:57,620 --> 05:18:58,940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: eh ngayon, nung nasira,

6824
05:18:59,020 --> 05:19:00,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pinagkakinaho namin ulit po.

6825
05:19:01,400 --> 05:19:02,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Agree po ako diyan, 100%.

6826
05:19:02,920 --> 05:19:04,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you very much po.

6827
05:19:04,340 --> 05:19:05,420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

6828
05:19:05,540 --> 05:19:05,860
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you.

6829
05:19:06,260 --> 05:19:07,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, from the majority,

6830
05:19:07,960 --> 05:19:10,540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: a short manifestation from Congresswoman Ana Fondo.

6831
05:19:11,400 --> 05:19:12,720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much po.

6832
05:19:14,060 --> 05:19:17,360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sec, can you tell us more about dredging?

6833
05:19:18,880 --> 05:19:20,740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And what's the policy na po?

6834
05:19:20,740 --> 05:19:25,700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I would like to thank Director Ilao and Usec. Calima po

6835
05:19:25,700 --> 05:19:29,160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: for the dredging na tinulong po nila sa amin.

6836
05:19:29,300 --> 05:19:31,620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, if you could just share a little po.

6837
05:19:31,920 --> 05:19:32,440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Apo.

6838
05:19:32,460 --> 05:19:34,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Very critical po.

6839
05:19:34,720 --> 05:19:37,380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang dredging at desilting.

6840
05:19:37,380 --> 05:19:41,420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Simply because medyo mayigit isang dekada na po

6841
05:19:41,420 --> 05:19:46,200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: since talagang nag-full blast ang dredging and desilting program

6842
05:19:46,200 --> 05:19:48,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng DPWH for various reasons,

6843
05:19:48,720 --> 05:19:51,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: which hindi na po ako mag-de-dwell doon.

6844
05:19:51,500 --> 05:19:54,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero nung kami po ay unang pumasok,

6845
05:19:54,780 --> 05:19:57,600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kinonsulta po namin ang mga eksperto

6846
05:19:57,600 --> 05:20:01,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: from Project NOAH to UP,

6847
05:20:02,400 --> 05:20:05,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pati po si Mr. Ramon Ang ng San Miguel Corporation.

6848
05:20:06,400 --> 05:20:10,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sinabi po nilang lahat na ang pinakamabilis,

6849
05:20:10,480 --> 05:20:13,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pinaka-mura,

6850
05:20:13,300 --> 05:20:18,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at pinaka-effective na initial intervention sa flood mitigation

6851
05:20:18,060 --> 05:20:22,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay ang pag-dredge, desilt, at pag-ilinis ng mga waterways.

6852
05:20:22,520 --> 05:20:24,580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At hindi lang po dredging ng major rivers,

6853
05:20:24,700 --> 05:20:27,960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kundi pati po mga magigit na waterways tulad ng mga estero,

6854
05:20:28,060 --> 05:20:29,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay kailangan i-desilt.

6855
05:20:29,980 --> 05:20:32,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po nag-launch po tayo nung November,

6856
05:20:32,140 --> 05:20:34,320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng operant contra baja kasama po si Pangulo.

6857
05:20:34,760 --> 05:20:36,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At nationwide po ito.

6858
05:20:36,960 --> 05:20:39,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At nakita na po natin ang mga epekto,

6859
05:20:39,700 --> 05:20:43,340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: hindi lang sa NCR, kundi sa Northern Luzon, sa Cagayan,

6860
05:20:43,540 --> 05:20:46,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa Tuguegarao, nakita po natin agad ang epekto doon.

6861
05:20:46,460 --> 05:20:50,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nakita po natin kahit papano ang epekto sa Central Luzon.

6862
05:20:50,560 --> 05:20:55,200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero kailangan po kasi sa dredging, hindi po ito one-time lang.

6863
05:20:56,060 --> 05:21:00,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po ito, at ito po ang paulit-ulit na sinasabi ng ating Pangulo,

6864
05:21:00,040 --> 05:21:06,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: this needs to be a regular maintenance program of the DPWH.

6865
05:21:06,080 --> 05:21:09,600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po, yun na po ang gusto nating mangyari ngayon.

6866
05:21:09,600 --> 05:21:12,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Simula po ngayong taon, tuloy-tuloy na po,

6867
05:21:12,480 --> 05:21:15,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kaya kami po bumibili ng equipment,

6868
05:21:15,020 --> 05:21:19,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: lalo na po yung mga magigit na backhoe on barge

6869
05:21:19,080 --> 05:21:22,320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na pwedeng pumasok sa kahit na mga magigit na estero,

6870
05:21:22,500 --> 05:21:24,760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: eh kailangan na po nating bilhin yan.

6871
05:21:25,020 --> 05:21:27,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil napaka-importante pong investment yan.

6872
05:21:27,560 --> 05:21:32,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At hindi na po natin pwedeng ipagpag-ibad ito.

6873
05:21:32,440 --> 05:21:34,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So yun po, tuloy-tuloy na po ito, ma'am.

6874
05:21:34,700 --> 05:21:38,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At makakaasa po kayo, we are constantly building up our capacity

6875
05:21:38,980 --> 05:21:42,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: to keep on dredging and dredging and cleaning our waterways.

6876
05:21:42,140 --> 05:21:44,100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much po.

6877
05:21:44,260 --> 05:21:45,880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And last na last na talaga.

6878
05:21:46,900 --> 05:21:48,980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I would just like to remind to, ano na po,

6879
05:21:49,220 --> 05:21:52,960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: not to remind but to just make aware.  Opo.

6880
05:21:54,400 --> 05:21:57,020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Marami po tayong foreign assisted projects.

6881
05:21:57,020 --> 05:21:58,960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Regarding flood control.

6882
05:21:59,220 --> 05:22:02,680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But the easiest po and the one that can happen po

6883
05:22:02,680 --> 05:22:04,060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: in less than six months,

6884
05:22:04,400 --> 05:22:06,620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Director Fano, kayo po yun.

6885
05:22:06,620 --> 05:22:09,280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yung ating po Korean loan part two.

6886
05:22:09,280 --> 05:22:12,800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ngayon ho, the President already said po

6887
05:22:12,800 --> 05:22:17,480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: na gagawin po yung Korean, kasi siya po ang nag-inaugurate ng part one.

6888
05:22:17,900 --> 05:22:21,400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, sayang naman po, again, an unfinished project.

6889
05:22:21,660 --> 05:22:22,920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: May part two po ito.

6890
05:22:22,980 --> 05:22:25,780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And nakikipagtulungan po tayo with Director Fano.

6891
05:22:25,820 --> 05:22:26,540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Paalala ko lang,

6892
05:22:26,640 --> 05:22:28,440
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: in less than six months po,

6893
05:22:28,600 --> 05:22:32,860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: tutukan lang po natin we can have a very productive loan po

6894
05:22:32,860 --> 05:22:33,940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: from Korea.

6895
05:22:33,940 --> 05:22:36,520
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, paalala lang po.

6896
05:22:36,520 --> 05:22:39,720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I'm sure si Director Fano will share all the details po with us.

6897
05:22:40,860 --> 05:22:42,660
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Nakakuha na po tayo ng RDC approval.

6898
05:22:42,660 --> 05:22:46,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And susunod na po ay dadalhin na po natin sa DepDev.

6899
05:22:46,000 --> 05:22:48,700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At papaspasan po natin ito para huma-approve.

6900
05:22:49,020 --> 05:22:50,320
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much po.

6901
05:22:50,320 --> 05:22:52,940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And again, thank you Director Fano.

6902
05:22:52,940 --> 05:22:54,740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And Yusek Sadaen.

6903
05:22:54,820 --> 05:22:57,760
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So sa inyo po lahat, again, maraming maraming salamat po.

6904
05:22:57,760 --> 05:23:00,820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And we appreciate all your efforts po.

6905
05:23:00,820 --> 05:23:02,900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kahit kami po ay nahihirapan.

6906
05:23:02,920 --> 05:23:05,860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ang feeling namin, nakatulong po kayo na malaki sa amin.

6907
05:23:05,860 --> 05:23:08,640
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And we wish to continue to work with you.

6908
05:23:09,520 --> 05:23:13,440
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Full support po ang 4th District of Pampanga sa inyo pong budget.

6909
05:23:13,740 --> 05:23:14,780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Maraming salamat po.

6910
05:23:16,000 --> 05:23:17,840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Kong Anna.

6911
05:23:18,760 --> 05:23:22,060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Before I call on the last interpellator from the minority.

6912
05:23:23,260 --> 05:23:25,620
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Secretary, marami sana akong tanong sa inyo.

6913
05:23:25,700 --> 05:23:28,260
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ang problema, akong magdidipinsan ng budget inyo.

6914
05:23:28,260 --> 05:23:29,400
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So hindi na lang akong magtatalong, di ba?

6915
05:23:29,740 --> 05:23:33,980
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, ang, manghihingi na lang kami ng tulong.

6916
05:23:34,000 --> 05:23:35,820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yung distrito ninyo sa Surigao del Sur,

6917
05:23:36,060 --> 05:23:38,780
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: yung 1st Surigao del Sur Engineering District,

6918
05:23:39,160 --> 05:23:44,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: after Basiang po, hanggang ngayon, maraming section pa rin,

6919
05:23:44,680 --> 05:23:47,140
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: mountainous section along Surigao de Abao Coastal Road,

6920
05:23:47,340 --> 05:23:49,340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: ang kalahati lang po ang mataanan.

6921
05:23:49,620 --> 05:23:55,960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yung mga 10-wheeler trucks, transporting cargos, cannot pass through the National Highway.

6922
05:23:55,960 --> 05:24:01,800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The problem is, Secretary, marami akong kalaban sa politika.

6923
05:24:01,800 --> 05:24:06,440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: At sinabi nila doon, akala namin manakas na dahil ikaw yung chairman ng Committee on Public Works.

6924
05:24:06,660 --> 05:24:13,400
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Hanggang ngayon ho, isang taon na halos hindi madaan ng kumpito yung aming kalsada dahil half-lane lang po.

6925
05:24:14,100 --> 05:24:17,860
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, if you can, may binigay na sa iyo si Clara na 40 million.

6926
05:24:17,860 --> 05:24:21,840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Doon sa immediate response fund.

6927
05:24:21,840 --> 05:24:26,720
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Pero ang hiningi yata ng inyong District Engineering Office po, is 300 million.

6928
05:24:27,880 --> 05:24:32,560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Baka ho, para hindi na tayo mapuna doon sa lugar na iyon.

6929
05:24:32,700 --> 05:24:34,220
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you so much, Mr. Secretary.

6930
05:24:39,040 --> 05:24:44,460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ano kakalampagin po namin ang release nung in-apply namin sa QRF?

6931
05:24:45,220 --> 05:24:48,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tututukan ko po ito, Mr. Chairman, para po mamaspasa natin.

6932
05:24:48,740 --> 05:24:49,200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Sana po.

6933
05:24:49,320 --> 05:24:54,140
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Early possible time, dahil medyo tag-ulan na naman. Baka tamaan na naman binang tag-ulan.

6934
05:24:58,440 --> 05:25:05,940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: This is main trunk line connecting Surigao del Norte, Surigao del Sur, Dabao Oriental, Dabao Norte, at saka Dabao City.

6935
05:25:08,060 --> 05:25:09,900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: You have our commitment, Mr. Chairman.

6936
05:25:10,020 --> 05:25:11,700
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Secretary. Thank you so much.

6937
05:25:12,120 --> 05:25:18,980
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Now, I will call on the last interpellator, Congressman Antonio Tinio from the minority.

6938
05:25:18,980 --> 05:25:20,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Chair.

6939
05:25:20,740 --> 05:25:22,840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Last interpellator for round 2.

6940
05:25:22,920 --> 05:25:23,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

6941
05:25:24,400 --> 05:25:30,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anyway, yung ano po, yan, okay.

6942
05:25:31,560 --> 05:25:32,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pagpapatuloy lang ito.

6943
05:25:33,080 --> 05:25:41,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kanina, tinalakay natin yung budget na malaki sa central office, mga proyekto hanggang sa region.

6944
05:25:42,240 --> 05:25:49,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon naman, may observation kami sa mga proyekto na nasa mga district engineering offices.

6945
05:25:49,960 --> 05:25:53,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa bilang namin, 199 ng DEOs. Tama ba?

6946
05:25:54,760 --> 05:25:55,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Is that correct?

6947
05:25:57,180 --> 05:26:00,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Correct. 199 DEOs.

6948
05:26:01,600 --> 05:26:06,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nakita namin sa ilang mga programa, hindi lahat ng DEO merong project.

6949
05:26:07,040 --> 05:26:14,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, for example, under flood management program, 87 DEOs. Walang flood control.

6950
05:26:15,320 --> 05:26:19,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, for example, sa BIP multipurpose buildings,

6951
05:26:20,360 --> 05:26:26,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 37 DEOs. Walang proposal for multipurpose buildings.

6952
05:26:27,280 --> 05:26:33,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, parang bungi-bungi yung sa mga DEOs. Ano po ang explanation doon?

6953
05:26:34,210 --> 05:26:41,600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang paliwanag po, Mr. Chairman, is meron pong mga, una yung mga DEOs po na nag-submit.

6954
05:26:41,720 --> 05:26:47,200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sila po yung nag-submit ng mga kumpletong rekisitos based doon sa bago nating mga reforma.

6955
05:26:47,280 --> 05:26:54,860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yun naman pong mga, pero hindi naman po ibig sabihin na wala silang i-implement na flood mitigation program.

6956
05:26:55,280 --> 05:27:06,740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron po dito, nasa region po, pero ito din po ay depende sa type of project, ibababa din po sa mga district offices.

6957
05:27:07,340 --> 05:27:15,600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po, halimbawa po yung sa region 11, most of the projects po are in the central and regional office.

6958
05:27:15,840 --> 05:27:26,960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Totaling roughly about 2.1 billion. Pero yan naman po, pagdating ng implementation ay ibababa din po yan sa mga DEOs para sila ang mag-i-implement.

6959
05:27:28,360 --> 05:27:41,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. So, ito actually yung tanong ko. May narinig tayo mga congressman, sinasabi nila, nako yung proyekto ko hindi lumabas. Wala dyan.

6960
05:27:42,560 --> 05:27:46,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May proyekto pero hindi galing sa akin. Sa central office galing. Okay.

6961
05:27:47,280 --> 05:27:59,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, I just want to correct the misconception na ang project ay central o ano. Lahat po ng mga proyekto natin ay nanggagaling sa baba.

6962
05:28:00,040 --> 05:28:16,920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang central po ay hindi nagdidikta ng proyekto. Hindi ko po alam dati ha. I cannot speak for the past. Pero dito po sa ginawa nating proseso ngayon, lahat po ng proyekto ay nanggagaling sa district, region,

6963
05:28:17,140 --> 05:28:30,740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: focusing on continuing and finishing the unfinished, closing the gaps if they are flood control, and continuing other projects such as pumping stations, and the like.

6964
05:28:30,740 --> 05:28:45,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: The only reason po na lumagabas sa NEP na sa central po is dahil po sa mga existing circulars na kinakailangan po ang baba ng mga budget authorities,

6965
05:28:45,000 --> 05:28:55,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: authorities, yung SARO po na tinatawag natin, e ibababa muna sa Central, DPWH, at yun po ay ibababa sa mga implementing offices.

6966
05:28:56,180 --> 05:29:00,100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero yung pong mga proyektong yun ay nanggagaling lahat sa baba.

6967
05:29:01,480 --> 05:29:04,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, siguro ang ibig sabihin nila doon, hindi sila ang proponent.

6968
05:29:04,960 --> 05:29:10,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, now, ang tanong ko actually is this.

6969
05:29:11,260 --> 05:29:19,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In the past, in the 2026 budget, nagsubmit ang DPWH ng extensive ERATA.

6970
05:29:20,000 --> 05:29:20,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alam nyo yun, di ba?

6971
05:29:20,940 --> 05:29:26,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, maraming mga nagbago talaga yung itsura ng budget na submit nyo.

6972
05:29:26,780 --> 05:29:32,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tanong ko, magsasubmit ba uli ng ERATA ang DPWH ngayon?

6973
05:29:36,320 --> 05:29:42,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang gagawin po namin ngayon ay base na rin po sa discussions ngayon, mga suggestions na gumabas.

6974
05:29:42,640 --> 05:29:50,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pati na rin po yung mga priorities na hindi po naipasok dito sa NEP

6975
05:29:50,000 --> 05:29:54,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil po sa mga priorities na nakita natin itong mga nakaraang abagat,

6976
05:29:54,320 --> 05:30:00,820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: magsasubmit po kami for consideration po ng House Appropriation Committees as Institutional Amendments.

6977
05:30:01,600 --> 05:30:08,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero yun po ay i-justify namin at i-deditagye po namin with the same documentary requirements

6978
05:30:08,880 --> 05:30:14,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: that we required dito po sa mga sinabmit ngayong National Expenditure Program.

6979
05:30:15,620 --> 05:30:21,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, so yes, magkakaroon ng irata. In other words, yung NEP na sinabmit nyo, magbabago pa yan,

6980
05:30:21,940 --> 05:30:24,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and will there be extensive changes?

6981
05:30:24,680 --> 05:30:26,420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I don't think it will be extensive changes.

6982
05:30:26,620 --> 05:30:34,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will make sure po na lahat po ng isisumiti namin ay justified based on need

6983
05:30:34,240 --> 05:30:36,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and based on the required documentation.

6984
05:30:36,720 --> 05:30:37,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

6985
05:30:41,600 --> 05:30:47,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, kanina meron datos, baka pwedeng i-forward doon, on the number of projects in the NEP, no?

6986
05:30:47,700 --> 05:30:48,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 11,000?

6987
05:30:49,260 --> 05:30:49,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo.

6988
05:30:49,940 --> 05:30:50,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

6989
05:30:51,160 --> 05:30:51,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nasaan yun?

6990
05:30:54,400 --> 05:30:55,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ah, yan po.

6991
05:30:55,780 --> 05:30:56,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan ba yun?

6992
05:30:56,520 --> 05:30:58,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, 11,395.

6993
05:30:58,600 --> 05:31:06,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nakatrack yan, makikita natin later on kung gaano karami yung madadagdag dito.

6994
05:31:06,360 --> 05:31:06,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo.

6995
05:31:06,820 --> 05:31:07,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

6996
05:31:07,300 --> 05:31:12,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, kapagka irata siya, sabi ang rule, di ba, pagka congressional insertion,

6997
05:31:12,660 --> 05:31:15,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: wala sa NEP, FLR, automatic.

6998
05:31:15,620 --> 05:31:15,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo.

6999
05:31:15,980 --> 05:31:16,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pag-irata.

7000
05:31:18,980 --> 05:31:20,180
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Please wind up.

7001
05:31:20,400 --> 05:31:26,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Actually, I think po, we will take the form of a amendment po.

7002
05:31:26,560 --> 05:31:27,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: As an amendment.

7003
05:31:28,040 --> 05:31:29,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po siya technically irata.

7004
05:31:30,560 --> 05:31:34,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yun po ang sabi sa akin ng ating mga planning lawyers.

7005
05:31:34,120 --> 05:31:37,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yun po ang initial na plano namin.

7006
05:31:40,500 --> 05:31:41,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, okay.

7007
05:31:41,180 --> 05:31:44,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Explain the, sabi ng legal nyo, explain the

7008
05:31:44,380 --> 05:31:44,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nuance.

7009
05:31:45,120 --> 05:31:50,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anong kaibahan ng irata as against amendment at anong implikasyonist yan?

7010
05:31:50,940 --> 05:31:59,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang pagkakaintindi ko po sa aking limited knowledge, dahil first budget po talaga nating sinusumite ito.

7011
05:31:59,840 --> 05:32:04,700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kapag po irata, yan po ay hindi i-EFLR.

7012
05:32:04,700 --> 05:32:11,300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero pag ito ay amendment, it will take the form of a change in the NEP.

7013
05:32:11,460 --> 05:32:14,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, ma-EFLR din po yan.

7014
05:32:16,340 --> 05:32:18,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Amendment is a congressional amendment.

7015
05:32:18,860 --> 05:32:19,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo

7016
05:32:19,000 --> 05:32:25,300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Of course, this is dependent on or subject to the wisdom of the, of Congress.

7017
05:32:25,920 --> 05:32:29,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In short, irata, there will be congressional.

7018
05:32:29,740 --> 05:32:33,220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Well, the usual term for that is insertions.

7019
05:32:34,920 --> 05:32:35,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, amendments.

7020
05:32:36,100 --> 05:32:40,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I think yung amendment naman po, I don't think that can be considered an insertion.

7021
05:32:40,060 --> 05:32:40,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I don't know, no?

7022
05:32:40,700 --> 05:32:41,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa pagkakaintindi ko po, no?

7023
05:32:42,093 --> 05:32:42,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7024
05:32:42,960 --> 05:32:46,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi ito naman po, kasama naman po sa power of the purse.

7025
05:32:46,600 --> 05:32:53,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang kongreso, yung pagbabago, I think insertion lang po ata siya kapag siya ay post-gap.

7026
05:32:54,860 --> 05:32:56,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa aking pagkakaintindi po, I could be wrong.

7027
05:32:56,980 --> 05:32:57,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7028
05:32:57,320 --> 05:32:58,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chairman.

7029
05:32:58,160 --> 05:33:00,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, irata, instead, congressional amendments.

7030
05:33:01,960 --> 05:33:04,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And, this will be subject to FLR.

7031
05:33:05,440 --> 05:33:05,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7032
05:33:06,920 --> 05:33:07,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7033
05:33:07,500 --> 05:33:09,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, Chair, alam kong time na, pero...

7034
05:33:09,620 --> 05:33:10,660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Last question na.

7035
05:33:11,980 --> 05:33:13,980
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Round three na lang, if ever.

7036
05:33:14,360 --> 05:33:14,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7037
05:33:15,560 --> 05:33:16,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Last question.

7038
05:33:16,980 --> 05:33:19,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito lang nga po yung concern natin.

7039
05:33:20,300 --> 05:33:23,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No, now, if we go to the next slide.

7040
05:33:25,000 --> 05:33:25,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sige pa.

7041
05:33:26,540 --> 05:33:27,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Doon na tayo sa...

7042
05:33:27,580 --> 05:33:27,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7043
05:33:28,120 --> 05:33:28,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Balik.

7044
05:33:30,500 --> 05:33:31,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pork barrel system.

7045
05:33:32,000 --> 05:33:35,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya po sinasabi namin, kahit sinabi niyong may reforma na,

7046
05:33:35,840 --> 05:33:37,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and nandito pa rin.

7047
05:33:38,180 --> 05:33:41,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Magkakaroon ng congressional amendments, insertions, etc.

7048
05:33:43,380 --> 05:33:47,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, kayo na nagsabi, pagka congressional amendment,

7049
05:33:47,100 --> 05:33:51,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: subject to FLR.

7050
05:33:51,120 --> 05:33:51,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Delay.

7051
05:33:52,480 --> 05:33:54,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron tayong statistic dyan.

7052
05:33:54,660 --> 05:33:55,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next slide po.

7053
05:33:57,240 --> 05:33:58,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Galing din sa presentation nyo.

7054
05:33:58,960 --> 05:34:10,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For 2026, out of 17,000 national projects, as of August, third quarter, 32% pa lang

7055
05:34:10,360 --> 05:34:12,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang na-award niyong projects.

7056
05:34:15,120 --> 05:34:15,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Delay.

7057
05:34:15,760 --> 05:34:22,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 32% ng proyekto para sa taon pa lamang ang naa-award, much less na natayo na.

7058
05:34:23,300 --> 05:34:26,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya nga, parang 2 years na ang minimum, diba?

7059
05:34:26,480 --> 05:34:27,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7060
05:34:27,520 --> 05:34:34,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: My point being, because of this system of errata, insertions, and so on,

7061
05:34:35,200 --> 05:34:42,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: talagang ang standard na timeline sa pagpapatayo, at least 2 years.

7062
05:34:44,200 --> 05:34:44,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Whether

7063
05:34:44,560 --> 05:34:46,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: malaking proyekto o maliit.

7064
05:34:46,640 --> 05:34:47,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di po ba?

7065
05:34:47,320 --> 05:34:51,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang point ko rito, ang bottleneck na sa economic growth.

7066
05:34:52,500 --> 05:34:57,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabihin natin, ito mismo ang sistema ng pagbabudget natin na pork barrel.

7067
05:34:59,240 --> 05:35:05,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na dahil nga, in-insert nyo yan, edi tatagal tayo dahil kailangang i-verify pa uli yung mga dokumento,

7068
05:35:05,560 --> 05:35:09,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and so on and so forth, delayed tayo.

7069
05:35:09,020 --> 05:35:10,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

7070
05:35:10,780 --> 05:35:11,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Totoo po yan.

7071
05:35:11,780 --> 05:35:13,600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Noong 2026 po yun ang nangyari.

7072
05:35:13,600 --> 05:35:17,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero hindi po natin i-anticipate na ganito din ang mangyari ngayon.

7073
05:35:17,320 --> 05:35:24,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil ito pong nakikita nyo ngayon, talaga pong practically na overhaul itong dinetnan natin na budget na ito.

7074
05:35:24,680 --> 05:35:30,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At rightly so, dahil tinanggal po ang flood control dyan, nag-reprioritize, kaya po talaga nagbago.

7075
05:35:30,600 --> 05:35:33,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We do not anticipate the same situation po ngayon.

7076
05:35:34,020 --> 05:35:37,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung meron pong mga magbabago, tingin ko po, limitado lang.

7077
05:35:37,540 --> 05:35:39,440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yun po ang aking opinion po.

7078
05:35:39,780 --> 05:35:41,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And again, uulitin ko po, Mr. Chairman,

7079
05:35:43,520 --> 05:35:49,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pong diferensya ngayon is, noong nakaraan, project title, cost.

7080
05:35:50,320 --> 05:35:53,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon po, hindi na po tayo papayag doon.

7081
05:35:53,040 --> 05:35:55,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po, e, kumpleto na po ng requirements.

7082
05:35:55,400 --> 05:35:59,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At dahil po din dyan, lalo na yung program of works, nandyan na po,

7083
05:36:00,260 --> 05:36:02,620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Eh, hindi po tayo masyadong tatagal.

7084
05:36:02,620 --> 05:36:07,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dapat, dahil naplano na ho ito, nalagyan na ng programa,

7085
05:36:07,500 --> 05:36:10,960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at ready to go na at shovel ready na po.

7086
05:36:10,960 --> 05:36:12,880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dapat ang mga proyektong ito.

7087
05:36:12,900 --> 05:36:20,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi tulad ng nakaraan na walang mga ganitong klaseng mga reksitos na strictly na in-enforce.

7088
05:36:21,060 --> 05:36:22,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you, Madam Chair.

7089
05:36:22,540 --> 05:36:23,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maraming salamat po.

7090
05:36:23,620 --> 05:36:23,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry.

7091
05:36:23,920 --> 05:36:31,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair pala, may karugtong ako na tanong, kaugnay po sa classrooms, round 3 na lang po.

7092
05:36:32,620 --> 05:36:33,460
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

7093
05:36:34,000 --> 05:36:34,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you.

7094
05:36:36,620 --> 05:36:37,440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you.

7095
05:36:40,320 --> 05:36:42,820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, the last one, from the minority.

7096
05:36:43,180 --> 05:36:48,600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Short manifestation from Kong Bong Suntay.

7097
05:36:48,800 --> 05:36:50,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

7098
05:36:50,540 --> 05:36:52,320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Actually, this is more of a clarification.

7099
05:36:52,320 --> 05:36:59,300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi, ang napapansin ko, for example, yung mga flood control na ginagawa at saka yung mga highways,

7100
05:37:01,340 --> 05:37:03,220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: kadalasan, bungi-bungi siya, e.

7101
