7102
05:37:09,900 --> 05:37:10,900
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ganon din sa kalsada.

7103
05:37:11,400 --> 05:37:14,340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Four lanes, ilang handreds

7104
05:37:14,340 --> 05:37:16,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: of meters, tapos magiging two lanes ulit.

7105
05:37:17,140 --> 05:37:20,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Then, ilang taon bago madugtungan ulit.

7106
05:37:20,820 --> 05:37:27,380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, ang nangyayari, yung kalsada, nagiging convenient na parking space lang para dun sa mga may-ari ng bahay sa gilid ng kalsada.

7107
05:37:28,180 --> 05:37:29,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi hindi naman nabubuo, e.

7108
05:37:30,000 --> 05:37:33,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ganon din yung observation ko sa mga ginagawang flood control.

7109
05:37:33,960 --> 05:37:37,900
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Why can't it just be a flagship program of the Office of the President?

7110
05:37:38,080 --> 05:37:40,360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pondohan yung isang buo para hindi bungi-bungi.

7111
05:37:40,360 --> 05:37:42,680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Instead of spreading it sa mga district.

7112
05:37:42,680 --> 05:37:44,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos nun, kina-cut na

7113
05:37:44,080 --> 05:37:47,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tig-50 million para lang maipit sa distrito.

7114
05:37:47,760 --> 05:37:50,420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Why can't it be implemented na lang?

7115
05:37:50,500 --> 05:37:51,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Make it a flagship program.

7116
05:37:52,140 --> 05:37:53,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pondohan yung buo.

7117
05:37:53,040 --> 05:37:54,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi it does not serve a purpose.

7118
05:37:54,880 --> 05:37:58,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Gagawa ng flood control na ilang metro lang.

7119
05:37:58,520 --> 05:38:00,160
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos nun, wala namang kadugtong.

7120
05:38:00,240 --> 05:38:02,380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Then, it defeats the purpose of doing it.

7121
05:38:03,280 --> 05:38:06,160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tama po kayo, Congressman Bong.

7122
05:38:07,180 --> 05:38:08,060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ideal po talaga.

7123
05:38:08,140 --> 05:38:08,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dapat ganon.

7124
05:38:09,400 --> 05:38:12,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang problema rin po is itong mga dinatnan nating mga...

