DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kagaya nung sinabi ninyo, tingi-tingi.

7126
05:38:15,380 --> 05:38:17,740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan po nating tapusin yan.

7127
05:38:17,740 --> 05:38:22,240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At while ideal po talaga yung buo na,

7128
05:38:22,380 --> 05:38:25,100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na centrally managed na,

7129
