DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero kailangan po talaga mag-focus

7141
05:39:03,140 --> 05:39:05,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang dami po kasi na, Mr. Chairman,

7142
05:39:05,640 --> 05:39:09,520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na nadatnan nating mga tingi-tingi na hindi tapos,

7143
05:39:09,520 --> 05:39:11,740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na hindi naman po nating pwedeng tapusin.

7144
05:39:11,780 --> 05:39:12,220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po,

7145
