DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: umabot po tayo sa ganong sitwasyon.

7150
05:39:31,220 --> 05:39:35,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na talagang centrally managed na.

7151
05:39:35,040 --> 05:39:37,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And, well, I look forward to that day na

7152
